{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17141","headline":"试中和节诏赐公卿尺诗 · 李观","name":"试中和节诏赐公卿尺诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淑节韶光媚，皇明宠锡崇。\n具寮颁玉尺，成器幸良工。\n岂止寻常用，将传度量同。\n人何不取利，物亦赖其功。\n紫翰宣殊造，丹诚厉匪躬。\n奉之无失坠，恩泽自天中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}